She's so stubborn.

297
00:30:39.047 --> 00:30:40.130
A tough one. too.

298
00:30:40.672 --> 00:30:41.880
It's okay.

299
00:31:12.505 --> 00:31:16.297
<i>Mom. let's farm fish.</i>
<i>I'll help you. I can take it.</i>

300
00:31:16.380 --> 00:31:19.172
